      "message": "kconfig will always set these values, so it doesn\u0027t make sense to check for a defined value here.\n\nThis could check whether each value is the hardware default and do nothing if it is, or always set the values and depend on kconfig defaults matching chip defaults for configurations that don\u0027t change any of these.\n\nI\u0027d prefer to do the former:\n```suggestion\n#if CONFIG_CHARGER_SM5803_PROCHOT_DURATION \u003d\u003d 2\n```\n(and similar for the other options added here)",
