      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is good, but since it\u0027s a lot of lines I\u0027d like to move it into a new file:\n\n```\nrsource \"drivers/sm5803/Kconfig.sm5803\"\n```\n\nKconfig.sm5803:\n\n```\nconfig PLATFORM_EC_CHARGER_SM5803\n\tbool \"Use the SM5803 charger\"\n\t...\n```",
