      "writtenOn": "2023-08-23T03:28:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I like how clear this is, but I don\u0027t think every option needs to repeat all of the details, since the overall choice help provides much of that information.\n```suggestion\n\t  PHOT_REG1[6:4] \u003d 000\n```\n\nThat this corresponds to a 100us time should be clear from the prompt, and the containing `choice` says that this sets the prochot duration. It might even be reasonable to omit the help on these, but specifying the value that gets set in the register seems useful.",
